 "build": {
  "id": "9c593168-2745-4972-aa1f-23266e0999f9",
  "title": "THE runeGOD",
  "description": "[overview]\nYo just blow dat sheit up mang\n\nwsp Zyzx ingame if you wanna discuss\n\n<Infamous> Is a small tight knit guild looking for more friends to do endgame raids and PvP! Looking to field a 15-25 man raid team for casual raids and progression. Whisper for an invite.\n\n[talents]\nThe riftblade capstones are worthless compared to taking both spellfire runes and elemental inscription and having near 24/7 upkeep on zenith as well as constant smolders.\n\n[rotation]\nsmash buttons until they ded, upkeep zenith\n\nweapon engraving air for single target\n\nweapon engraving earth + primordial fury for aoe\n\nWater tattoos to max mana, otherwise stay on fire tattoos (not weapon engraving)\n\n[stats]\nagi obviously\n\n[gear]\nthe biggest slowest fuckoffest twohander. Makes weapon engraving air go giga on single target.",
